{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>ארח חיים</b> (the path of life) — which is above, for the discerning. That is to say, the discerning one will engage in doing the will of his Maker, perhaps he will walk in the path of life which is above, and it is the life of the soul that yearns to return to Elohim, so that she turn away from Sheol which is below."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:02.078716921Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}